        "Content": "<ul><li> Stunning 3 bedroom detached house with detached workshop / studio </li><li> Lovely landscaped gardens surrounding the house </li><li> Separate workshop / studio </li><li> Level walking distance of Oughterard village </li><li> Exclusive development where properties rarely come to the market</li></ul>"
      },
