      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From The Square in Oughterard, proceed along Camp Street, keeping The Lake Hotel on your left and The Boat Inn on your right, travel down this road for approximately 250 metres and bear right before the new river bridge. Proceed down to the Green and number 2 Owenriffe Park will be foundon the right hand side marked by our \"FOR SALE\" board."
